2026-10-06 (America/Los_Angeles) — readiness description reconciliation. The earlier Main readiness review below and fresh closed dependencies remain authoritative; no active claim or open linked PR was present. Corrected obsolete blocking wording in the description without changing acceptance, subjects, evidence pins, owned paths, PR allowance or dependencies.

Historical wording preserved: Blocked until #420 and #421 complete their separately owned evidence packets;

2026-10-06 readiness review: #420 and #421 have completed their separately owned evidence packets; this bounded source-only research is ready under normal claim checks;

Ready means this source-only investigation can be claimed normally. It grants no geographic approval, imports or production permission. New source limits and any later dependency/ownership change still require review.
